OL,3,GNEWSAGiant data centre plans lodged for
OL,4,Aold nuclear plant site
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been submitted for a #16.5bn
OL,7,Fdata centre at the site of the former
OL,8,FChapelcross nuclear plant in the south
OL,9,Fof Scotland.
OL,11,FIf approved, developers claim the
OL,12,Fscheme could deliver more than 500
OL,13,Ffull-time jobs - and it would be one of
OL,14,Fthe biggest in the world in terms of
OL,15,Fits power capacity.
OL,17,FApplicant CX Tech Ltd hopes work could
OL,18,Fstart on the project next year with it
OL,19,Ftaking about eight years to complete.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
