OL,3,GNEWSAGiant data centre plans lodged for
OL,4,Aold nuclear plant site
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the project was in line with
OL,7,Fattempts to redevelop the site but
OL,8,Fopponents have raised concerns over its
OL,9,Fvisual impact, as well as its effect on
OL,10,Flocal energy supplies and costs.
